---
title: Bread Pudding
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 50 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@dry bread cubes{2%cups}
@butter{1%Tbsp}
@sugar{0.75%cup}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@scalded milk{4%cups}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@slightly beaten eggs{4}
@raisins{0.5%cup} (if desired)

Soak bread in milk for 5 minutes. Add butter, salt and sugar. Add slowly to eggs. Add vanilla and mix well. Pour into greased baking dish and bake in a pan of hot water at 350 degrees for 50 minutes. Serve hot with lemon sauce.
